     1,5HPN-PO,5X,4HKP2N,2X,1HM,3X,1H*,9X)                              SUB32440
      WRITE OUTPUT TAPE 6,170,T1,TH1R,E2,AID2,T2,T3,KP2N,M              SUB32450
